    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A monitor is positioned on the top side of the layout. For every tie in the scene, it is placed below the monitor, and there is a bowl located below the tie which is smaller than the monitor. Additionally, for every tie, there is a backpack and a laptop on the right side of the image, where the backpack is positioned below the monitor and above the laptop, and the backpack is larger than the laptop.",
